(deflisten SYSINFO :initial '{"battery":{"level":"100%","status":"Charging","icon":"󰁹"},"brightness":{"level":"0%","status":"On","icon":"󰃚"},"volume":{"level":"10%","status":"low","icon":"󰝞"},"wifi":{"level":"","status":"Connecting","icon":"󰖩"},"bluetooth":{"level":"-","status":"-","icon":"-"}}' "/home/belcaik/Dev/SabiStat/target/release/SabiStat --notifarea")
(defwidget sysinfo []
  (box
    :class "sysinfo"
    :halign "start"
    :spacing 15
    (label :text "${SYSINFO.brightness.icon}"
      :class "brightness"
      ; :hexpand false
      :halign "end"
      :tooltip "${SYSINFO.brightness.level}"
    )
    (label :text "${SYSINFO.volume.icon}"
      :class "volume"
      :halign "end"
      :tooltip "${SYSINFO.volume.level} ${SYSINFO.volume.status}"
    )
    (label :text "${SYSINFO.wifi.icon}"
      :class "wifi"
      :halign "end"
      :tooltip "${SYSINFO.wifi.level} ${SYSINFO.wifi.status}"
    )
    (label :text "${SYSINFO.battery.icon}"
      :class "battery"
      :halign "end"
      :tooltip "${SYSINFO.battery.level} ${SYSINFO.battery.status}"
    )
    
  )
)
